{
  "_source": "leasewatch 1.0 behaviour (switch.py before profiles): Q-BRIDGE dot1qTpFdbPort, dot1dBasePortIfIndex with 'assume base port = ifIndex' on a miss (research notes Focus 1 and Focus 2, LibreNMS bridge.inc.php), LLDP local port via lldpLocPortId/lldpLocPortDesc name then ifIndex (Focus 3, first steps of LibreNMS PortFinder), uplink = LLDP neighbour or >= 6 MACs (leasewatch's own heuristic, Focus 5), GETNEXT walks with timeout 4 s and 1 retry. Profiles may set snmp.bulk true to use GETBULK with snmp.max_repetitions (Focus 6: Telegraf/Zabbix default 10). OIDs: notes' OID table.",
